<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech CNB-120 index rises 1.2 points to 912.7 pts.</title>
<headline>Czech CNB-120 index rises 1.2 points to 912.7 pts.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The CNB-120 index, a broad daily measure of Czech equities, rose 1.2 points on Wednesday to 912.7, the Czech National Bank (CNB) said.</p>
<p>Three of the ten sectoral indices gained, with the machinery index rising most, up 14.1 points to 1,233.8.</p>
<p>Seven indices lost, with the energy index losing most, down 12.2 points to 1,086.6.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
